  "bindingContract": [
    "Fresh shared prepare(tag_prefix=reader-measurements-) first creates reviewed source-stamped Info/project local overlays. Only then capture environment and source preparation; all other selected source bytes must match committed HEAD before and after collection.",
    "Reuse stage capture-environment only. Bind actual Debug settings, Xcode/SDK/Simulator runtime/UDID, raw input digests, source commit, current CI run/attempt and built local/synthetic Simulator app metadata/source stamp/executable digest. Explicit ENABLE_DEBUG_DYLIB YES additionally requires the real nonempty executable-basename.debug.dylib and its hash; NO records no main debug payload. An optional declared derived path must match if present, and its original absence stays null. Re-read the complete tested-host identity after collection. No fifty-row stage execution or proof of instruction execution from hashes is implied.",
    "Three original dedicated xcodebuild -l logs, result bundles, summaries and modern tests trees are independently gated. Exact 1/1, 1/1 and 11/11, no extra/duplicate/parameterized/failed/skipped/expected-failure cases. Every leaf must descend from the unique selected target bundle; unit/UI cannot borrow the other's bundle type.",
    "Original shape helper remains unchanged and shape-only; execution validation additionally requires actual wrapper/export success and original XCTest source identities. Raw measurement marker bytes survive failed/incomplete collection. Source/environment/artifact/log drift cannot leave a successful group.",
    "All recoverable groups run and retain evidence before combined final failure. Initial unsafe local-overlay preparation does not launch any host. Fatal abort/deadline may leave incomplete artifacts, never success or synthetic replacement."
  ],
